   "text": "Good evening, everyone, and thank you for coming along tonight. My name's Karen Webb, and I'm the manager here at Ashford Park. As most of you know, the park reopened to the public last month after being closed for almost two years, and this evening I'd like to tell you a bit about what's changed, and how you can get involved."
